    {
      "id": "jm_pr_20260723_complete_cormetech_scr_catalysts_s2",
      "locator": "About Cormetech",
      "quote": "Founded in 1989, Cormetech is a globally leading, high-growth US manufacturer of Selective Catalytic Reduction (“SCR”) catalysts serving over 400 long-standing customers."
    },
    {
      "id": "jm_pr_20260723_complete_cormetech_scr_catalysts_s3",
      "locator": "策略理由",
      "quote": "In particular, Cormetech's IP in gas turbines and module designs will enable JM to offer customised best-in-class catalysts and systems for a range of energy platforms."
    },
    {
      "id": "jm_pr_20260723_complete_cormetech_scr_catalysts_s4",
      "locator": "策略理由",
      "quote": "It is expected to materially enhance Clean Air Solutions’ scale, helping to establish a combined deep market presence in the US’s power generation market, which is seeing strong demand through the rapid construction of data centres."
